To achieve your goal of extracting the **domain**, **Head of Marketing (CMO/Director of Marketing)** name, and their **LinkedIn profile** for a given company using the **Programmable Search Engine (PSE)** and **Google Sheets**, follow this structured approach:

---

### **Step 1: Set Up Programmable Search Engine**
1. **Create a Custom Search Engine**:
   - Go to [Google Custom Search Engine (CSE)](https://cse.google.com/cse/).
   - Create a new search engine and add the websites you want to search (e.g., company websites, LinkedIn, or news sites).
   - Get the **Search Engine ID** (CSE ID) for later use.

2. **Enable API Access**:
   - Go to [Google Cloud Console](https://console.cloud.google.com/).
   - Create a project and enable the **Custom Search Engine API**.
   - Get an **API key**.

